DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Wenn du mir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}was Süßes{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} gibst, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
verrate ich dir, wovor die Leute
hier Angst haben,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hah! Seni güzel yakaladım! {{TAG:0003:001C:}}Eminim {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Jack{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
benimle gurur duyardı!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hazır {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Jack{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
demişken, seninle konuşmak istiyormuş!
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Git de ne istediğine bak.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Pero esto qué es?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
